# Product-molecularity fixture: 100 rings A.B.X. The rule deletes X and the A-B
# bond, claiming two products, A and B. BNG2.pl writes no DeleteBond for X's
# bonds, which go with X; once X is gone A and B are apart, so the network fires
# the rule at rate k: Afree(1) = 100 (1 - e^-1) = 63.2. Main never fired it with
# block_same_complex_binding=True; a search that walks through X never fires it.
begin model
begin parameters
  k 1
end parameters
begin molecule types
  A(b,x)
  B(a,x)
  X(a,b)
end molecule types
begin seed species
  A(b!1,x!3).B(a!1,x!2).X(b!2,a!3) 100
end seed species
begin observables
  Molecules Afree A(b,x)
end observables
begin reaction rules
  A(b!1,x!2).B(a!1).X(a!2) -> A(b,x) + B(a) k DeleteMolecules
end reaction rules
end model
writeXML()
